	(text "Signed compare: two's-complement operands are converted to offset binary by inverting bit 31 of SCORE and MAX; the 8x 74HC85 cascade then performs an unsigned magnitude compare.  GT (Oa>b) is strict greater-than.\nTie rule: GT=0 for equal scores, so MAX and INDEX are not updated; the first (lowest-numbered) class wins.  Class 0 is loaded unconditionally in LD0.  Do not compare these scores as uint32."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 552 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c8ae2059-7cf8-4dab-a0a6-f472d5f208d9")
	)

	(text "Read sequence: INIT clears CLASS and BYTE; for each class BYTE=0..3: RD -> WT (wait MEM_ACK) -> BYDONE (wait MEM_DONE) -> BYNEXT.  SCORE_ADDR = {CLASS,BYTE} = class*4+byte; SCORE_RD is high in RD/WT.\nAfter BYTE=3: class 0 -> LD0 (load MAX/INDEX), classes 1..9 -> CMP; NEXT increments CLASS and clears BYTE until CLASS=9, then DONE.  FSM: IDLE -> INIT -> ... -> DONE -> WAIT -> IDLE.  RUN is set by ARGMAX_START and cleared at DONE; BUSY=RUN&~DONE.  RESULT_VALID=DONE|WAIT."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 566 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "16e8447e-aec9-448b-98ba-aada0dd01f4c")
	)

	(text "S12 latches DATA[7:0] into the four byte lanes on MEM_ACK; SCORE_DATA is the assembled little-endian 32-bit word.  Each byte is one S02 REQ/ACK transaction at byte address class*4+byte in FC2_LOGITS.  RESULT is the 4-bit class index (0..9), held valid until the next ARGMAX_START."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 580 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0cea4b9c-dbe4-4da3-bb0d-55ff7125f92b")
	)

	(embedded_fonts no)
)
